                            </h3>
                            <div className="h-64 w-full flex gap-4">
                                <div className="flex-1">
                                    <p className="text-xs text-center font-bold text-stone-400 mb-2">VYBAVENÍ</p>
                                    <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="100%">
                                        <PieChart>
